1
00:00:00,354 --> 00:00:02,944
- Lf and when?
- Maybe we should change the subject.

2
00:00:03,157 --> 00:00:05,987
(Penny:)Amy, how are your lady parts?
Still chilly down there?

3
00:00:08,262 --> 00:00:12,752
(Bernadette:)Hang on. None of Sheldon's theories
have ever been definitively proven.

4
00:00:12,966 --> 00:00:15,496
(Bernadette:)My husband actually went
to outer space.

5
00:00:15,736 --> 00:00:17,366
(Amy:)That's an impressive accomplishment.

6
00:00:17,604 --> 00:00:19,934
(Amy:)He's now an inspiration
to millions of Americans...

7
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:24,300
(Amy:)...who know you don't have to be special
or even qualified to go into space.

8
00:00:24,511 --> 00:00:27,781
(Penny:)You know, I remember the first time
I got a bikini wax.

9
00:00:27,981 --> 00:00:31,851
(Penny:)My sister did it with melted Crayolas
and duct tape.

10
00:00:32,152 --> 00:00:34,952
Yeah, it's a bad idea.

11
00:00:37,024 --> 00:00:39,284
(Bernadette:)Gosh, Amy. I'm sensing a little hostility.

12
00:00:39,493 --> 00:00:43,953
(Bernadette:)Is it maybe because, like Sheldon's work,
your sex life is also theoretical?

13
00:00:47,501 --> 00:00:49,301
(Penny:)Damn.

14
00:00:50,971 --> 00:00:52,801
(Amy:)Well, at least when we do make love...

15
00:00:53,006 --> 00:00:58,026
(Amy:)...Sheldon won't be thinking
about his mother.

